#. Purchase disclaimer in the premium subscription checkout. Consumer law text, translate faithfully. {premiumProductName} is a product name and stays untranslated. {PAYMENT_PROVIDER_NAME} is the payment processor name. Withdraw means using the consumer right of withdrawal to cancel the purchase, never taking money out. The first withdraw is a link to the section of the terms that explains how to withdraw and has the withdrawal form, so wrap the words your language uses for that action. The UK is the United Kingdom. The terms set how long each withdrawal period lasts and how much comes back, so the sentence names no number of days and no refund amount. A payment dispute is a chargeback filed with a bank or card company. The second link, our terms, goes to the section of the terms of service on payment disputes. Action against the account means enforcement such as suspension or deletion.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/PurchaseDisclaimer.tsx
msgid "Self-serve refunds are available within 3 days of payment, once every 30 days. Refunding a subscription cancels it. If you are a consumer in the EU, the EEA, the UK or Brazil, you can <0>withdraw</0> until your withdrawal period ends, even after {premiumProductName} starts. Please ask for a refund before you dispute a charge. A dispute about a wrong or unauthorized charge never leads to action against your account, and <1>our terms</1> list the only cases where a dispute can. {PAYMENT_PROVIDER_NAME} handles payment securely. We never see your full card number."
msgstr ""

#. Sentence after the privacy sentence in the Operator Pass checkout dialog that names the company selling the pass. Fluxer Platform AB is the company name and 559537-3993 its Swedish organization number, keep both as is. Haninge is the Swedish municipality where the company is registered and stays as is. Translate registered office with the legal term your language uses for the registered seat of a company, and keep the Swedish word säte in parentheses. The address, phone number and email address are filled in and stay as is. Use the same word for seller as on a receipt.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/PurchaseDisclaimer.tsx
msgid "Seller: Fluxer Platform AB, 559537-3993, registered office (säte) Haninge, Sweden, {OPERATOR_PASS_SELLER_ADDRESS}, {OPERATOR_PASS_SELLER_PHONE}, {SUPPORT_EMAIL}."
